        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, high voltage, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, high voltage, at grid
Transmission losses are taken from Itten, Frischknecht and Stucki (2014): LCI of Electricity Mixes and Grid.; UUID:b29c2511-45c2-33b2-b08e-39580e0fe346
This dataset describes the transmission of the consumer mix 2019 in Switzerland and includes the high voltage network infrastructure (including long-distance transport), transmission losses and air pollutant emissions. Not included are electricity losses due to long-distance transport since they are assumed to be contained in the total electricity losses of the country network.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistics
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b29c2511-45c2-33b2-b08e-39580e0fe346.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
